### FILES
service_operations.log | Log of service build/deploy/remove operations
(other logs created by services at runtime)

### RULES
- Logs should not contain secrets
- Rotate logs as needed
- Include timestamps in all entries

### GITIGNORE
*.log files should be in .gitignore
